     1340        LABEL "&Фирма"
     1341        SIZE 10 BY 1.
     1342   DEFINE BUTTON b-del
     1343        LABEL "&Удал."
     1344        SIZE 10 BY 1.
     1345   DEFINE BUTTON B-Help
